WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.428
Vinnie and Magua returned to the village.

2
00:00:10.429 --> 00:00:13.404
They had caught plenty of fish.

3
00:00:13.405 --> 00:00:18.343
Families were gathering for the Corn Festival dances.

4
00:00:18.344 --> 00:00:21.067
Everyone was celebrating!

5
00:00:21.068 --> 00:00:24.604
"Come, Vinnie, we must eat," said Magua.

6
00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:28.001
Baskets of food were passed around.

7
00:00:28.002 --> 00:00:30.207
"This is great!"

8
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:33.153
Vinnie bit into some corn bread.

9
00:00:33.154 --> 00:00:37.184
He also had some corn soup and roasted corn.

10
00:00:37.185 --> 00:00:39.937
He was so hungry!

11
00:00:39.938 --> 00:00:43.008
Suddenly, Magua groaned.

12
00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.007
He held his stomach.

13
00:00:45.008 --> 00:00:48.006
"What's the matter?" asked Vinnie.

14
00:00:48.007 --> 00:00:52.014
"I feel sick," Magua said weakly.

15
00:00:52.015 --> 00:00:55.023
Clan Mother walked over to them.

16
00:00:55.024 --> 00:00:58.722
"What's the matter, Magua?" she asked.

17
00:00:58.723 --> 00:01:00.884
Vinnie explained.

18
00:01:00.885 --> 00:01:04.204
"Call the healers," she ordered.

19
00:01:04.205 --> 00:01:08.344
"Bring them to my house."

20
00:01:08.345 --> 00:01:13.958
Inside the longhouse, Magua lay on a bed by the wall.

21
00:01:13.959 --> 00:01:18.112
Soon, Vinnie heard strange noises.

22
00:01:18.113 --> 00:01:21.601
People were shaking rattles and chanting.

23
00:01:21.602 --> 00:01:24.778
"What's that?" he asked.

24
00:01:24.779 --> 00:01:28.812
"The healers are here," Clan Mother said.

25
00:01:28.813 --> 00:01:33.321
Vinnie heard scratching sounds at the door.

26
00:01:33.322 --> 00:01:35.677
Clan Mother let them in.

27
00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:40.349
People wearing ugly masks danced into the room.

28
00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.879
Vinnie almost screamed.

29
00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.876
The carved masks were scary.

30
00:01:45.877 --> 00:01:50.010
A large tongue hung out of the mouth of one mask.

31
00:01:50.011 --> 00:01:55.602
The healers called out in screeching voices and jumped around.

32
00:01:55.603 --> 00:01:57.646
Vinnie was afraid.

33
00:01:57.647 --> 00:02:00.937
But Magua did not look frightened.

34
00:02:00.938 --> 00:02:03.285
He only looked sick.

35
00:02:03.286 --> 00:02:06.341
The masked group came closer.

36
00:02:06.342 --> 00:02:09.630
They threw ashes on Magua.

37
00:02:09.631 --> 00:02:14.136
They leaned over him and chanted louder.

38
00:02:14.137 --> 00:02:18.962
"Stay away! He's my friend!" Vinnie shouted.

39
00:02:18.963 --> 00:02:24.681
At that moment, Mandy and Onatah came into the house.

40
00:02:24.682 --> 00:02:28.020
Onatah held their corn husk doll.

41
00:02:28.021 --> 00:02:32.013
"What's going on?" asked Mandy.

42
00:02:32.014 --> 00:02:38.272
She saw the masked dancers around Vinnie and screamed.

43
00:02:38.273 --> 00:02:41.153
"Don't touch him!" she cried.

44
00:02:41.154 --> 00:02:44.807
Mandy ran and stood in front of her brother.

45
00:02:44.808 --> 00:02:46.828
The dancers stopped.

46
00:02:46.829 --> 00:02:49.212
They murmured to each other.

47
00:02:49.213 --> 00:02:53.874
"Vinnie! Mandy!" Clan Mother was angry.

48
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:56.455
"You should never stop the healers!

49
00:02:56.456 --> 00:02:58.477
It is our tradition.

50
00:02:58.478 --> 00:03:01.006
It is how the sick get well."

51
00:03:01.007 --> 00:03:04.406
Vinnie and Mandy were embarrassed.

52
00:03:04.407 --> 00:03:08.542
"We're sorry," they apologized.

53
00:03:08.543 --> 00:03:12.092
"Clan Mother," Magua called weakly.

54
00:03:12.093 --> 00:03:14.346
He tried to sit up.

55
00:03:14.347 --> 00:03:16.089
"I'm feeling better.

56
00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.303
Maybe I ate too much corn bread."

57
00:03:18.304 --> 00:03:20.427
He smiled weakly.

58
00:03:20.428 --> 00:03:25.933
"Clan Mother, what are we to do?" asked one of the healers.

59
00:03:25.934 --> 00:03:29.031
Clan Mother looked at Magua.

60
00:03:29.032 --> 00:03:32.406
"He seems better," she replied.

61
00:03:32.407 --> 00:03:34.192
"You have cured him.

62
00:03:34.193 --> 00:03:36.839
Your magic is good."

63
00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:40.006
The dancers left the house.

64
00:03:40.007 --> 00:03:44.138
"We were very scared," Mandy said.

65
00:03:44.139 --> 00:03:47.391
Clan Mother nodded and said:

66
00:03:47.392 --> 00:03:51.407
"You do not understand the magic of the Iroquois.

67
00:03:51.408 --> 00:03:53.601
That is why you fear."

68
00:03:53.602 --> 00:03:57.942
"I don't know much about your people," said Vinnie.

69
00:03:57.943 --> 00:04:00.816
"But Mandy and I would love to learn."

70
00:04:00.817 --> 00:04:05.000
Clan Mother placed a hand over her heart.

71
00:04:05.001 --> 00:04:09.833
"I will tell you how the Iroquois became the Five Nations.

72
00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:15.271
It was through one man's journey for peace—Deganawidah.

73
00:04:15.272 --> 00:04:22.028
Here is his story."
